    "description": "Perched on Bernal's prized North Slope, this gorgeous, modern 3lvl home w breathtaking views has it all! Steps to Precita Park's green space and beloved cafes and restaurants, the home was renovated in 2022 and offers the ideal layout: 3BDRs upstairs, a versatile 4th BDR suite/family room down, 3 full BAs plus a powder, laundry room, pro landscaped south-facing garden, gym space, and an oversized two-car garage with storage. Sunken living room w outlooks to twin peaks and downtown  anchored by a w/b fireplace. The LR flows into a spacious dining space w views - entertainer's delight! Pro kitchen w marble counters, 2 Bosch ovens, marble work island, and plenty of storage, opens to a family + breakfast space. Sliding glass flows to a sun-filled south facing Ipe deck + garden - perfect for grilling, kid play, and lounging. Upstairs, the primary suite w 180 degree vus, 2 closets, tiled ensuite, and a private vu deck. 2 add'l BDRs + another full BA. Downstrs: flexible 4th BDR suite/fam rm w en suite tiled bath. Plus laundry rm, gym, + huge storage rm. Interior 2 car garage w Tesla Powerwalls. Wide-plank wd floors, all new baths/windows, new HVAC, central A/C, tankless WH + modern systems. 3.5 blks to Precita Park + PP Cafe. Walk to Doma Sushi, Harvest Hills, Cortland, Bernal Hill. Wow"
  },
